look material
# View x600..1320 top y216; bar centre (960,244); Clear ~(1236,244), Ask ~(1280,244); results from y~280.
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
rec sp-m-open 1 ipc panels open spotlight TESSERA-TEST
note Track the view's top edge/width: QML and Rust settle in about 0.3 s with overshoot at most 2 percent (before Rust bounced visibly to 0.45 s). Rust first moving frame earlier than QML earlier.
wait 1
rec sp-m-close 0.6 key -k Escape
note Escape closes in about 154 ms.
wait 1
ipc panels open spotlight TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
rec sp-m-grow 1 key f
note View springs to the list's height in about 0.3 s; height curve QML vs Rust within 1 frame.
wait 1
key -k BackSpace
wait 1
rec sp-m-rows 1 key fi
note Rows rise and fade in one after another (28 ms apart); compare frame strips with QML.
wait 1
shot sp-m-fi
note View with app rows, 56 px pill bar, Clear and Ask at the right; Colloid icons; palette matches QML.
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1236 244 200
wait 1
shot sp-m-clear-hover
note Clear hovered: 8 percent layer.
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1280 244 200
wait 1
shot sp-m-ask-hover
note Ask hovered: 8 percent layer.
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 1236 244 200 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot sp-m-cleared
note Clear emptied the field and refocused it (caret in field, no results).
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot sp-m-inside-click
note Click inside the view (centre) did not close Search.
ptr move 960 900 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot sp-m-scrim-click
note Click on the scrim at (960,900) closed Search.
